      "explanation": "<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 29th July Evening Shift Physics - Electrostatics Question 131 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l7e9e2ip/7ad5cc7e-7a59-4e8b-9ba9-345351172840/d4237b10-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9e2iq.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Let two identical spheres have charge q. And distance between them = r</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Force between the spheres <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.871ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.816ex\" height=\"3.285ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1066.9 4338.8 1452\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1138,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1804.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2860.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(521,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(543.7,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(425.3,-377.4) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(484,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"1238.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now when an identical uncharged sphere C comes in contact with A, charge q on sphere A get's divided equally to both sphere.</p>\n<p>So, both sphere A and C have charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.184ex\" height=\"2.567ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -789.7 1849.3 1134.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(234.1,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, C get's in contact with B. So their total charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.791ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.674ex\" height=\"2.713ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -849.5 3392 1199\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(458,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(682.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1682.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(234.1,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2934,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> gets divided equally.</p>\n<p>So, charge on both B and C is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.183ex\" height=\"3.365ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1142.4 5384.7 1487.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,584) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(460,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1238,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(234.1,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(761.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"1636.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3210.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4265.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(382.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><rect width=\"878.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, C is place midpoint between A and B.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l7e9ep9c/5965f3b9-8c69-4efc-b7b6-a7969ef15cbd/e5b46600-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9ep9d.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l7e9ep9c/5965f3b9-8c69-4efc-b7b6-a7969ef15cbd/e5b46600-2752-11ed-a077-1f1e3989e798/file-1l7e9ep9d.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 29th July Evening Shift Physics - Electro